  "solution": "Hàm số <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là một nguyên hàm của hàm số <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>k</mi><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∫</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tSuy ra\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tQuần thể vi khuẩn ban đầu gồm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>500</mn></semantics></math> vi khuẩn nên với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, hay <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br> Suy ra\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mn>0</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tdo đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tSuy ra\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>500</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVì sau <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> ngày, số lượng vi khuẩn của quần thể đó đã tăng lên thành <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>600</mn></semantics></math> vi khuẩn, tức là khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, hay <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tdo đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tKhi đó, công thức tính số lượng vi khuẩn của quần thể đó tại thời điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>t</mi></semantics></math> là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>150</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>t</mi><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVậy số lượng vi khuẩn của quần thể đó sau <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>7</mn></semantics></math> ngày là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>352</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">(vi khuẩn)</mtext><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
